{"resourceIdentifier":"4709","resourceName":"Strengthening rural livelihood through carbon finance: Agroforestry practices in Gorakhpur Forest Circle of Uttar Pradesh","description":"The proposed ARR VCS project plans to promote sustainable agroforestry for farmers to provide financial benefits and ensure GHG mitigation in Uttar Pradesh, India.  Agroforestry in Uttar Pradesh is a dynamic, ecologically based natural resource management system through which the integration of trees/woody perennials in farms and rangelands diversifies, and sustains production for increased social, economic, and environmental benefits.The project shall enhance farmer communities’ income, biodiversity conservation, and soil health improvement.","location":{"latitude":26.765841,"longitude":83.364939},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-10-31","endExclusive":"2023-12-01","endInclusive":"2023-11-30"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4709"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Department of Environment, Forest and Climate Change, Government of Uttar Pradesh"},{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"36813"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AMS0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"874405 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE"